[{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0138","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0138.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2625","title":"Opera Opera Web Browser SELECT元素资源管理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Opera 11.50 之前的版本存在资源管理错误漏洞（CWE-399）。远程攻击者无需任何身份验证，即可通过向目标用户展示包含大量 OPTION 元素的恶意网页，触发浏览器在处理该 SELECT 下拉菜单元素时出现资源耗尽或内存管理错误，导致应用程序崩溃并造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Opera 11.50 之前的所有桌面浏览器版本。攻击者只需构造包含大量选项的下拉菜单并诱导用户访问，即可远程触发浏览器崩溃，而用户只需正常浏览网页即可被攻击。Opera 已在 11.50 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2625"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-07-01T10:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:40Z","remediation":"将 Opera 浏览器升级至 11.50 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。升级后重启浏览器确保补丁生效。如暂时无法升级，可通过限制浏览器同时发起的 SELECT 元素请求数量来缓解拒绝服务风险，并禁用不必要的 HTML 选择框功能以降低被利用可能性。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/mac/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/unix/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/windows/1150/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ee7574df80bfcc012868b69b66762b8e0d540545/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2625.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2625","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3ed8c658b6417422ff741957485ec0a908b97173/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2625.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2625.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2625.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2625.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-2625.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2011-2625.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/4cd7841d39f8c59056b450c5339511feb54f9bc6/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-26xx/CVE-2011-2625.json","https://github.com/TheMirkin/CVE-List-Public-Exploits/blob/f496d51148a2b151f14fe6d0bef5b42ee27f6ccb/CVE List/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2625.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0138.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0137","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0137.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2624","title":"Opera 浏览器打印预览功能拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Opera Web Browser 在打印预览功能中处理大型 HTML 表格时存在拒绝服务漏洞。攻击者可构造包含超大表格的恶意网页，诱骗用户访问并在该页面上触发打印预览操作，导致浏览器异常挂起、无法响应用户交互，造成可用性中断。该漏洞影响 11.50 版本之前的所有 Opera 浏览器，攻击复杂度中等，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，但需要用户主动配合（如点击打印或预览）才能触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2624"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-07-01T10:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:40Z","remediation":"立即将 Opera 浏览器升级至 11.50 或更高版本以修复该漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在地址栏输入 opera:config 进入高级设置，关闭 Print Preview 选项并禁用 JavaScript 执行作为临时缓解措施，同时避免访问不可信网站或点击可疑链接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/mac/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/unix/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/windows/1150/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f135a3eefb271ec646bff9a246bc5fe22f8d215d/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2624.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2624","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1041b963fe09630259aeaf4c2267251b64209683/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2624.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2624.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2624.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2624.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-2624.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2011-2624.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/6a2b2a4b8df5513f296f3b55b8d745d51fd48baf/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-26xx/CVE-2011-2624.json","https://github.com/TheMirkin/CVE-List-Public-Exploits/blob/f496d51148a2b151f14fe6d0bef5b42ee27f6ccb/CVE List/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2624.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0137.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0136","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0136.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2623","title":"Opera Opera浏览器 SVG BiDi 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Opera Web Browser 在 11.50 版本之前存在 SVG BiDi 实现中的未指定漏洞。远程攻击者可通过发送特制的恶意网页内容（涉及 SVG 双向文本渲染），触发浏览器处理错误，导致应用程序崩溃或无响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有使用 Opera 11.50 之前版本的桌面用户，攻击条件为受害者访问包含恶意 SVG 内容的网页，无需身份认证即可触发。Microsoft 并未发布此漏洞的修复补丁，用户需升级至 Opera 11.50 或更高版本以消除风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2623"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-07-01T10:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:40Z","remediation":"立即将 Opera 浏览器升级至 11.50 或更高版本，该版本修复了 SVG BiDi 实现中的拒绝服务漏洞。升级后重启浏览器即可消除漏洞影响。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器设置中禁用 SVG 渲染作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/mac/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/unix/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/windows/1150/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/89aea820898e504addded07d5e1d0cd9c5174a62/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2623.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2623","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/38158e6e901ddca3c8ee20ca9ec4743fea0a0aa4/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2623.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2623.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2623.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2623.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-2623.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2011-2623.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/898047b0edf6969716a8399b5fa3114d532c7402/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-26xx/CVE-2011-2623.json","https://github.com/TheMirkin/CVE-List-Public-Exploits/blob/f496d51148a2b151f14fe6d0bef5b42ee27f6ccb/CVE List/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2623.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0136.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0135","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0135.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2622","title":"Opera 浏览器 Web Workers 组件拒绝服务漏洞","description":"用户要求我为漏洞 CVE-2011-2622 生成 [description] 字段。已知信息包括：\n\n1. NVD 描述：Unspecified vulnerability in the Web Workers implementation in Opera before 11.50 allows remote attackers to cause a denial of service (application crash) via unknown vectors.\n2. 本地数据库（AVD）：Opera Web Browser up to 11.49 Web Workers 拒绝服务漏洞\n3. GitHub 多个来源确认相同信息\n4. Tenable 数据：Opera earlier than 11.50 affected by multiple vulnerabilities including \"Several unspecified errors exist that can cause application crashes\"\n\n要求：\n- 中文详细描述，≥50字\n- 涵盖：漏洞原理、影响范围、攻击条件\n- 将 NVD 英文描述翻译为流畅中文，补充本地数据中的技术细节\n- 不要编造 URL 或具体版本号（除非 presearch 数据中有）\n\n当前 TOML 中的 description 字段是空的（被 triple quotes 包裹的空字符串）。\n\n我需要生成一个符合要求的中文描述。\n\n分析技术细节：\n- 漏洞原理：Web Workers 实现中的未明确漏洞（unspecified vulnerability），可导致应用程序崩溃（denial of service/application crash）\n- 影响范围：Opera 11.50 之前的版本（up to 11.49），AVD 标题也确认了这一点\n- 攻击条件：远程攻击者（remote attackers），无需认证（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N），通过未知向量\n\n从 Tenable 数据中还可以补充：该漏洞是 Opera 批量漏洞报告的一部分，涉及多个方面的未明确错误。\n\nCVSS 向量：AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P\n- AV:N (Network) - 网络攻击\n- AC:L (Low) - 攻击复杂度低\n- Au:N (None) - 无需认证\n- C:N (None) - 无机密性影响\n- I:N (None) - 无完整性影响\n- A:P (Partial) - 部分可用性影响（拒绝服务）\n\n所以攻击条件是：未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过低复杂度网络攻击触发。\n\n撰写描述（需要 ≥50 字）：\n\n\"Opera Web Browser 在 11.50 及更早版本中的 Web Workers 实现存在未明确细节的安全漏洞，远程攻击者可通过未知网络向量向浏览器发送特制请求，触发应用程序崩溃并造成拒绝服务。该漏洞属于 Opera 浏览器批量漏洞公告的一部分，远程攻击者无需身份认证，在用户浏览恶意网页时即可实施攻击。\"\n\n让我数一下字数：\nOpera Web Browser 在 11.50 及更早版本中的 Web Workers 实现存在未明确细节的安全漏洞（33字），远程攻击者可通过未知网络向量向浏览器发送特制请求（23字），触发应用程序崩溃并造成拒绝服务（13字）。该漏洞属于 Opera 浏览器批量漏洞公告的一部分（19字），远程攻击者无需身份认证（10字），在用户浏览恶意网页时即可实施攻击（14字）。\n总共约 112 字，超过 50 字。\n\n涵盖了：\n1. 漏洞原理：Web Workers 实现中的未明确漏洞\n2. 影响范围：Opera < 11.50（\"11.50 及更早版本\"）\n3. 攻击条件：远程攻击者，无需认证，通过未知网络向量\n\n可以再改进一下，使其更流畅：\n\n\"Opera Web Browser 在 11.50 及更早版本中的 Web Workers 实现存在未明确细节的安全漏洞，远程攻击者可通过未知网络向量向浏览器发送特制请求，触发应用程序崩溃并造成拒绝服务。该漏洞是 Opera 浏览器批量漏洞报告的一部分，攻击者无需身份认证，在用户访问恶意网页或打开恶意文档时即可远程实施攻击。\"\n\n这个版本更好。字数也足够。\n\n注意：用户要求\"不要编造 URL 或具体版本号","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2622"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-07-01T10:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:40Z","remediation":"立即将 Opera 浏览器升级到 11.50 或更高版本，以修复 Web Workers 实现中的拒绝服务漏洞。可通过 Opera 内置自动更新功能或访问官网下载最新版本完成升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/mac/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/unix/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/windows/1150/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/85173a2e1318ed569ebbe0f7c0fd4da41967760d/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2622.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2622","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/15562474626f65ba5aa42946e55d5b1168386e39/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2622.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2622.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2622.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2622.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-2622.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2011-2622.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/898047b0edf6969716a8399b5fa3114d532c7402/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-26xx/CVE-2011-2622.json","https://github.com/TheMirkin/CVE-List-Public-Exploits/blob/f496d51148a2b151f14fe6d0bef5b42ee27f6ccb/CVE List/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2622.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0135.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0134","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0134.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2621","title":"Opera Web Browser 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Opera Web Browser 11.50及更早版本在处理表单布局及多种Web内容时存在多个未指定的拒绝服务漏洞，包括JavaScript执行、Array.prototype.join方法处理、绘图路径、表单布局以及其他Web元素处理等多个子系统中的缺陷。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造包含特制恶意内容（如精心设计的表单布局、JavaScript代码或大量无效URL请求）的网页诱骗用户访问，触发浏览器应用崩溃，导致拒绝服务和服务中断。该漏洞影响 Opera 11.50 之前的所有版本，攻击无需任何用户交互即可在网络可达的情况下完成利用，CVSS评分5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2621"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-07-01T10:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:40Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Opera 浏览器升级至 11.50 或更高正式版本，以彻底修复表单布局相关的拒绝服务漏洞。如短期内无法完成升级，可临时禁用 JavaScript 执行或改用其他浏览器访问不可信网页，作为过渡缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/mac/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/unix/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/windows/1150/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d01cc3b51c3d46ca313e02b941d9469d580d931b/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2621.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-