/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/unix/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/windows/1150/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f38c5fdc2d5ae016cb5ff615cdaf3941dc98e9f4/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2620.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2620","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2620.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2620.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2620.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2620.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-2620.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2011-2620.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-26xx/CVE-2011-2620.json","https://github.com/TheMirkin/CVE-List-Public-Exploits/blob/f496d51148a2b151f14fe6d0bef5b42ee27f6ccb/CVE List/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2620.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0133.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0132","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0132.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2619","title":"Opera Opera Web Browser 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Opera 浏览器 11.50 之前版本在处理包含大量停止点的 CSS 渐变时，其 CANVAS 元素、SVG 和 CSS 实现存在资源管理错误，远程攻击者可通过构造恶意网页诱导用户访问，触发浏览器应用程序崩溃导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Opera 11.50 之前所有版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，仅需用户访问包含恶意 CSS 渐变的网页即可触发拒绝服务，CVSS 评分 5.0（中等危害）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2619"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-07-01T10:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:39Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Opera 浏览器至 11.50 或更高版本（访问 https://www.opera.com/download 官方下载最新版）。无法立即升级时，可暂时禁用浏览器的 Canvas/SVG 渲染功能（在 opera:config 中禁用 \"Enable Canvas\" 和 \"Enable SVG\" 选项）或改用其他浏览器作为临时缓解措施，避免访问不可信网站。企业环境可通过组策略或软件分发系统统一推送 Opera 11.50+ 更新包强制升级全网终端。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/mac/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/unix/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/windows/1150/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f38c5fdc2d5ae016cb5ff615cdaf3941dc98e9f4/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2619.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2619","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2619.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2619.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2619.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2619.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-2619.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2011-2619.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-26xx/CVE-2011-2619.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2011/CVE-2011-2619.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2011/POC-AVE-2011-0132.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0132.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0131","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0131.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2618","title":"Opera Web Browser 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Opera 11.50 之前版本存在远程拒绝服务漏洞，攻击者可通过网页脚本在窗口间移动 AUDIO 或 VIDEO 元素，触发浏览器内存管理错误导致应用程序崩溃。该漏洞影响 Opera 11.50 之前所有版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（中危），攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度低，无需认证，仅影响可用性。攻击者只需诱导用户访问包含恶意脚本的网页，即可触发浏览器崩溃造成拒绝服务。Opera 已在 11.50 版本中修复该漏洞，建议用户升级至 11.50 或更高版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2618"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-07-01T10:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:39Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Opera 浏览器至 11.50 或更高版本（官网 https://www.opera.com/download 下载最新版）。若暂时无法升级，可暂时禁用 JavaScript（设置→隐私与安全→网站设置→JavaScript→禁止）或避免访问不可信网站，作为临时缓解措施防止音视频元素跨窗口移动触发崩溃。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/mac/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/unix/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/windows/1150/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f38c5fdc2d5ae016cb5ff615cdaf3941dc98e9f4/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2618.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2618","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2618.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2618.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2618.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2618.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-2618.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2011-2618.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-26xx/CVE-2011-2618.json","https://github.com/TheMirkin/CVE-List-Public-Exploits/blob/f496d51148a2b151f14fe6d0bef5b42ee27f6ccb/CVE List/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2618.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0131.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0130","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0130.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2617","title":"Opera Opera Web Browser 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Opera浏览器11.50之前的版本在处理数据URI、错误页面和文本节点选择等功能时存在多重安全漏洞。攻击者可远程发送精心 crafted 的IPv6数据包或触发特定场景（如文本节点选择、已关闭弹出窗口、IFRAME元素等），导致浏览器无法处理引发应用程序崩溃和拒绝服务。漏洞影响范围涵盖所有Opera浏览器11.50之前的桌面及移动设备版本，涉及的攻击表面非常广泛，包括但不限于打印功能、JavaScript执行、渲染路径、音频/视频处理、Canvas绘制、CSS文件、表单布局、Web Workers等15+关键功能模块。攻击者无需任何认证即可执行，攻击复杂性较低，风险主要集中在系统可用性层面。虽然该漏洞目前主要表现为应用程序崩溃，但同时也存在潜在的远程代码执行风险。CVSS评分为5.0（A:P），表明该漏洞严重影响系统稳定性，可能为更高级别的攻击行为埋下隐患。Microsoft等浏览器厂商已陆续针对这些安全问题发布了多个紧急更新，并建议用户尽快升级到最新版本以获取保护。Opera Web Browser系列漏洞（CVE-2011-2610~CVE-2011-2627）是一系列与Web渲染引擎相关的安全问题（CWE-119）、弱点类型（WASC-31）和威胁范型（WASC-41）等安全问题总括，受到攻击者特别关注，被广泛用于Web应用安全研究和测试。​是浏览器安全开发中一个典型的议题，常被用作Web浏览器安全预警预警系统的基准案例，涉及安全策略、开发规范、部署实施、事件响应、技术研究、管理策略和安全文化等诸多层面安全建设。​ Linux（Ubuntu，CentOS），Windows等操作系统用户均需关注。​​​","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2617"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-07-01T10:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:39Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Opera 浏览器升级至 11.50 及以上版本，可通过官网 https://www.opera.com/download 下载最新安装包进行覆盖安装。如暂时无法升级，可禁用 JavaScript 并避免访问不可信网站作为临时缓解措施，减少触发崩溃的攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/mac/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/unix/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/windows/1150/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f54d76ab772484c9516adea70c89afaeb5255051/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2617.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2617","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7