EProject/cvelistV5/blob/f54d76ab772484c9516adea70c89afaeb5255051/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2616.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2616","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c0a11fc313619dcf9bfdd0db79ab9694b1de45d2/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2616.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2616.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2616.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2616.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-2616.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2011-2616.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-26xx/CVE-2011-2616.json","https://github.com/TheMirkin/CVE-List-Public-Exploits/blob/f496d51148a2b151f14fe6d0bef5b42ee27f6ccb/CVE List/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2616.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0129.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0128","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0128.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2615","title":"Opera Web Browser远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"这是一个导致 Opera 浏览器崩溃的拒绝服务漏洞。受影响的 Opera 浏览器版本低于 11.50 时的错误页面处理机制存在缺陷，当用户持续访问无效 URL 时，浏览器生成的错误页面会逐渐占用主机磁盘空间。当磁盘空间耗尽时，浏览器将崩溃并留下残留的错误文件。通过不断提交无效 URL 的方式可以触发此漏洞，导致目标系统无法正常使用 Opera 浏览器。攻击者无需身份验证即可远程执行此攻击，影响范围涵盖所有使用旧版 Opera 浏览器的用户，存在较低的攻击复杂度。该漏洞通过浏览器占满磁盘空间的资源耗尽机制引发，可导致服务中断，CVSS 评分为 5.0，属于中危漏洞。Microsoft 和 Opera 厂商已发布安全补丁修复此问题，建议用户立即升级到最新版本以获取保护。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2615"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-07-01T10:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:39Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Opera 浏览器升级到 11.50 或更高版本，该版本已修复此拒绝服务漏洞。若暂时无法升级，可通过禁用 JavaScript 或限制访问不可信网站作为临时缓解措施，并建议定期清理浏览器缓存防止磁盘空间耗尽导致崩溃。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/mac/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/unix/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/windows/1150/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f54d76ab772484c9516adea70c89afaeb5255051/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2615.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2615","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c0a11fc313619dcf9bfdd0db79ab9694b1de45d2/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2615.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2615.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2615.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2615.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-2615.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2011-2615.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-26xx/CVE-2011-2615.json","https://github.com/TheMirkin/CVE-List-Public-Exploits/blob/f496d51148a2b151f14fe6d0bef5b42ee27f6ccb/CVE List/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2615.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0128.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0127","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0127.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2614","title":"Opera Web Browser SVG 渲染远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Opera 浏览器存在 SVG 渲染漏洞，其处理特定大量字符路径时出现异常，导致浏览器崩溃和拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Opera 11.50 及更早版本，通过向目标发送特制的 SVG 文件即可触发。攻击者无需身份验证即可远程利用此漏洞，触发浏览器崩溃，破坏系统的可用性。NVD 报告的 CVSS 评分显示这一漏洞的严重性，攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂性低，对可用性的影响为完全。该漏洞存在于 Opera 浏览器的核心渲染引擎中，对用户体验和系统稳定性造成严重影响。攻击者可以通过构造复杂的 SVG 文件来触发这一漏洞，导致浏览器崩溃和拒绝服务攻击，影响网络应用的正常运行。攻击者可以在网络中诱使用户访问恶意网站，触发浏览器漏洞，导致浏览器崩溃和拒绝服务攻击，最终影响网络应用的正常运行。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2614"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-07-01T10:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:39Z","remediation":"立即升级Opera浏览器至11.50或更高版本，获取包含所有已知安全修复的正式发布版。如无法立即更新，可临时禁用Opera对大量无效URL的自动错误页面生成功能，并限制一次请求路径字符数量，避免磁盘空间耗尽导致浏览器崩溃。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/mac/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/unix/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/windows/1150/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fc5c3e6f60accc24b7eac4fd31472f0e5fd97f24/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2614.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2614","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2614.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2614.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2614.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2614.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-2614.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2011-2614.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-26xx/CVE-2011-2614.json","https://github.com/TheMirkin/CVE-List-Public-Exploits/blob/f496d51148a2b151f14fe6d0bef5b42ee27f6ccb/CVE List/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2614.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0127.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0126","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0126.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2613","title":"Opera Web Browser 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Opera Web Browser 11.50 之前版本中 Array.prototype.join 方法存在资源管理错误漏洞，攻击者可通过构造包含初始空洞的非数组对象，触发 join 方法处理异常导致浏览器应用程序崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Opera 11.50 之前所有版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程诱导用户访问恶意网页触发漏洞，CVSS 评分 5.0（中危），主要影响可用性。Opera 已在 11.50 版本中修复该漏洞，用户升级至 11.50 或更高版本即可修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2613"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-07-01T10:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:39Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Opera 浏览器升级至 11.50 及以上版本，可通过 Opera 官网 (https://www.opera.com/) 下载最新版本安装包覆盖安装，或在浏览器菜单中选择\"关于 Opera\"触发自动更新。若暂时无法升级，建议暂停使用 Opera 浏览器访问不可信网站，改用 Chrome、Firefox 等已修补浏览器作为临时替代方案。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/mac/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/unix/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/windows/1150/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fc5c3e6f60accc24b7eac4fd31472f0e5fd97f24/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2613.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2613","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2613.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2613.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2613.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2613.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-2613.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2011-2613.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-26xx/CVE-2011-2613.json","https://github.com/TheMirkin/CVE-List-Public-Exploits/blob/f496d51148a2b151f14fe6d0bef5b42ee27f6ccb/CVE List/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2613.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0126.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0125","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0125.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2612","title":"Opera Opera 浏览器 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Opera浏览器存在多个安全漏洞，影响版本低于11.50。攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的IPv6数据包或触发多个无效URL请求，利用浏览器错误处理机制导致浏览器崩溃或磁盘空间耗尽，从而实现拒绝服务攻击。尽管有报告指出可能存在远程代码执行风险，但官方评级显示主要影响是应用崩溃。攻击者无需身份验证即可远程触发此漏洞，导致浏览器无法正常工作，严重影响用户网络体验。该漏洞涉及Opera对网络内容处理机制的多重缺陷，包括错误页面生成机制、数据URI处理异常以及多个浏览器组件（如JavaScript、打印功能、CSS布局等）的解析漏洞。攻击者可通过精心构造的恶意网页或特定协议数据包触发这些漏洞，实现对受害者浏览器的控制或使其瘫痪。微软等浏览器厂商已陆续对Opera浏览器进行了安全补丁更新，用户应及时升级至支持的安全版本以获取防护。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2612"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-07-01T10:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:39Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Opera 浏览器至 11.50 或更高版本，可访问官网 https://www.opera.com/download 下载最新安装包并覆盖安装。若暂时无法升级，建议暂时禁用 JavaScript 或使用其他浏览器访问不可信网站，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/mac/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/unix/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/windows/1150/","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fc5c3e6f60accc24b7eac4fd31472f0e5fd97f24/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2612.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2612","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2612.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2612.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2612.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2612.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-2612.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2011-2612.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-26xx/CVE-2011-2612.json","https://github.com/TheMirkin/CVE-List-Public-Exploits/blob/f496d51148a2b151f14fe6d0bef5b42ee27f6ccb/CVE List/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2612.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0125.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0124","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0124.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2611","title":"Opera Opera浏览器 打印功能拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Opera 浏览器 11.50 之前版本的打印功能存在未明确的漏洞，远程攻击者可诱导用户访问精心构造的恶意网页，触发打印功能处理逻辑缺陷导致浏览器崩溃，造成拒绝服务（应用程序崩溃）。该漏洞影响 Opera 11.50 之前所有版本，涉及打印功能、JavaScript 处理、数组操作、SVG/Canvas 渲染、iframe 处理等多个组件。攻击需要用户交互（访问恶意页面），攻击向量为网络，攻击复杂度中等，无需认证，仅影响可用性（CVSS 4.3，AV:N/AC:M/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P）。Opera 11.50 版本已修复此漏洞，用户升级至 11.50 或更高版本即可修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2611"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-07-01T10:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:38Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Opera 浏览器至 11.50 或更高版本，官方已在 11.50 版本修复此打印功能拒绝服务漏洞。升级方式：访问 Opera 官网下载最新版本覆盖安装，或通过浏览器菜单「帮助」→「检查更新」自动升级。若暂时无法升级，建议避免打印不可信网页内容，或在打印前预览确认页面内容安全，临时禁用打印功能可作为临时缓解措施。建议尽快完成版本升级以彻底修复该漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/mac/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/unix/1150/","http://www.opera.com/docs/changelogs/windows/1150/","https://gi